==== CFE ====

''CFE> flashimage openwrt-96348GW-bc221-squashfs-cfe.bin''

==== Update OpenWrt ====

''root@OpenWrt:~# cd /tmp
root@OpenWrt:~# wget http://downloads.openwrt.org/.../openwrt-96348GW-bc221-squashfs-cfe.bin
root@OpenWrt:~# sysupgrade openwrt-96348GW-bc221-squashfs-cfe.bin''


===== Serial Console =====

The board contains a 4 pin header next to the right side of the main CPU.
Settings are 115200 8N1, no flow control.

|
       (Back)
    _____________
   /             \  [5V]
   |             |  [RX]
   | BCM6348KPBG |  [TX]
   |             |  [GD]
   |             |
   \_____________/

       (Front)
|


